    },
    {
      "id": "claim_151e7c579d3b476ca0bf527a99bdc3ae",
      "statement": "In a .collection, the embedded_instances data value re-serialises with chunk boundaries at each inner escaped-newline position, structural lines owning their chunks, and the inner string's closing quote on its own chunk at the outer escape level — the exact line \"\\\"\\n\" and never the double-escaped form.",
