    {
      "id": "claim_b5e5f539275346fda42243ff83f39f05",
      "statement": "Quotedness is carried by type, not content: the parser wraps bare enum-like tokens in BareIdent(str) and the serializer emits BareIdent unquoted only on an ASCII ident fullmatch, so plain strings (even all-caps ones like a component id 'HUD') always emit quoted and control characters in scalar strings are escaped (\\\\t, \\\\r, \\\\n by name; other chars below 0x20 as \\\\xNN).",
